-        If application metadata has not been provided by the upstream, it should be licensed with FSFAP or Creative Commons Zero, version 1. Please see the specification for other recommended licenses.
-        The project_license value must be a valid SPDX license identifier or a valid SPDX license expression, including operators like AND, OR, WITH. Proprietary licenses must use LicenseRef-proprietary with a link to the license. Custom licenses use the LicenseRef-<identifier> format.
